    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tired; temperature up to 37.8 °C; no chills</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Clear rhinorrhea and sore throat; no ear or facial pain</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Wheeze, chest tightness, and dry cough, worse at night; no hemoptysis</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain or palpitations beyond a fast pulse after reliever doses</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No nausea, vomiting, or reflux symptoms</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
